{"seq":2,"slug":"competitive-advantage","title":"研究生 战略管理 — 竞争优势的来源与持续性","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/management/strategic-management-grad/competitive/competitive-advantage","wordCount":2472,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"研究生-战略管理-竞争优势的来源与持续性\">研究生 战略管理 — 竞争优势的来源与持续性</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>竞争优势为何存在、如何形成、能否持续——这三个问题构成了战略管理学科最核心的理论议题。从 Chamberlin (1933) 的垄断竞争到 Barney (1991) 的 VRIO 框架，从 Porter (1985) 的价值链到 Teece (2007) 的动态能力，学界对竞争优势的理解经历了从外部定位到内部资源、从静态到动态的深刻转变。</p>\n<p>竞争优势的衡量涉及多个层面：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>衡量维度</th>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>理论基础</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>会计绩效</td>\n<td>ROA、ROE、利润率</td>\n<td>超过行业均值即存在优势</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>经济利润</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi = R - C - OC</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>包含机会成本的超额回报</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>托宾 Q</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q = \\frac{MV}{RC}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2173em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>市场价值/重置成本 &gt; 1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>总股东回报</td>\n<td>异常收益 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>CAPM/Fama-French 残差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>持续性</td>\n<td>利润自相关系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><msub><mi>π</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi_t = \\alpha + \\beta\\pi_{t-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9028em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>理解竞争优势的核心在于区分<strong>创造价值（Value Creation）<strong>和</strong>捕获价值（Value Capture）</strong>。一个企业可以创造巨大的消费者剩余，但如果无法阻止模仿和竞争侵蚀，这些价值最终会流向消费者或供应商。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"定位学派-从外部结构寻找优势\">定位学派：从外部结构寻找优势</h3><p>Porter (1985) 的竞争战略理论认为，竞争优势来源于企业在产业价值链中的<strong>战略定位</strong>。三种基本战略——成本领先、差异化、聚焦——代表了不同的价值主张与活动配置方式。</p>\n<p><strong>成本领先</strong>要求企业在提供可接受质量的前提下，实现行业最低的累计成本。成本优势的来源包括：规模经济（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AC(Q)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 递减）、学习曲线效应（累计产量翻倍时单位成本下降 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 比例）、流程创新和要素成本差异。Wright (1936) 首先在航空制造业发现了学习曲线：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_n = C_1 \\cdot n^{-b}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 单位的成本，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>学习率</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b = \\frac{\\log(\\text{学习率})}{\\log 2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.4911em;vertical-align:-0.4811em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.01em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">l</span><span class=\"mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.485em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">l</span><span class=\"mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">学习率</span></span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4811em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，典型的学习率在 70%-90% 之间。</p>\n<p><strong>差异化</strong>要求企业创造消费者愿意支付溢价的独特价值。差异化的关键在于其驱动因素（Differentiation Drivers）：技术特征、品牌声誉、服务网络、定制能力等。有效的差异化必须满足三个条件：消费者能感知到差异、差异对消费者决策有影响力、竞争对手难以快速复制。</p>\n<p>Porter 进一步提出**活动系统（Activity System）<strong>的概念：竞争优势不在于单一活动的卓越，而在于活动之间的互补性和一致性。当企业的活动系统高度紧耦合时，竞争者无法通过模仿单一环节获得同等优势——这就是</strong>战略契合（Strategic Fit）**的力量。IKEA 是经典案例：自助服务、扁平包装、郊区大店面、瑞典设计风格相互强化，构成了难以拆解模仿的系统。</p>\n<h3 id=\"资源基础观-从内部禀赋寻找优势\">资源基础观：从内部禀赋寻找优势</h3><p>资源基础观（RBV）将分析焦点从产业结构转向企业内部。Barney (1991) 提出，持续竞争优势来自同时满足 VRIO 四个条件的资源和能力：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>有价值（Valuable）</strong>：资源能够帮助企业利用外部机会或中和威胁</li>\n<li><strong>稀缺（Rare）</strong>：竞争者中少有企业拥有该资源</li>\n<li><strong>难以模仿（Inimitable）</strong>：存在模仿壁垒</li>\n<li><strong>组织化利用（Organized）</strong>：企业有能力有效运用该资源</li>\n</ul>\n<p>模仿壁垒的三个来源值得深入理解：</p>\n<p><strong>因果模糊性（Causal Ambiguity）</strong>：即使竞争者观察到了优势结果，也无法准确识别哪些因素导致了这种优势。这通常发生在优势源自复杂的资源组合和隐性知识时。Reed &amp; DeFillippi (1990) 认为复杂性、专用性和隐默性是因果模糊的三个维度。</p>\n<p><strong>历史依赖性（Path Dependence）</strong>：资源积累取决于特定的历史路径，后来者无法压缩时间。Dierickx &amp; Cool (1989) 用&quot;资源存量&quot;（Resource Stock）和&quot;资源流量&quot;（Resource Flow）的隐喻说明了时间压缩不经济（Time Compression Diseconomies）：将 R&amp;D 投入翻倍不能将知识积累时间减半。</p>\n<p><strong>社会复杂性（Social Complexity）</strong>：企业文化、人际网络、供应商信任等资源嵌入在复杂的社会关系中，无法通过市场交易获得。</p>\n<h3 id=\"知识基础观与动态能力\">知识基础观与动态能力</h3><p>Grant (1996) 将 RBV 进一步发展为<strong>知识基础观（KBV）</strong>，认为知识——特别是隐性知识——是企业最重要的战略资源。企业存在的根本原因在于它比市场更擅长整合分散在个体中的专业知识。知识整合的效率取决于：共同知识的范围、整合频率和灵活性、以及组织结构与知识结构的匹配度。</p>\n<p>**动态能力（Dynamic Capabilities）**则回应了 RBV 被批评的静态性问题。Teece, Pisano &amp; Shuen (1997) 将动态能力定义为企业整合、构建和重新配置内外部能力以应对快速变化环境的能力。Teece (2007) 进一步将其分解为三个维度：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>感知（Sensing）</strong>：识别和评估新机会与威胁的能力</li>\n<li><strong>捕获（Seizing）</strong>：设计商业模式并动员资源抓住机会的能力</li>\n<li><strong>转型（Transforming）</strong>：持续更新和重组组织资产的能力</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Helfat &amp; Peteraf (2003) 提出的&quot;能力生命周期&quot;模型描述了能力从创建、发展到成熟、可能退化或分支的演化过程，为理解动态能力的微观基础提供了时间维度。</p>\n<h3 id=\"竞争优势的持续性\">竞争优势的持续性</h3><p>持续竞争优势（Sustained Competitive Advantage, SCA）是战略管理的&quot;圣杯&quot;，但其存在性受到越来越多的质疑：</p>\n<p><strong>超竞争观点（Hypercompetition）</strong>：D&#39;Aveni (1994) 认为在快速变化的环境中，任何竞争优势都是暂时的。企业应该追求一系列临时优势的连续构建，而不是维持单一优势。McGrath (2013) 的**瞬时优势（Transient Advantage）**理论进一步发展了这一观点，主张企业需要掌握优势的发现-利用-脱离循环。</p>\n<p><strong>实证证据</strong>的结论较为混合。Wiggins &amp; Ruefli (2002) 分析了 6772 家企业 25 年的数据，发现仅有少数企业能维持超过 10 年的超额回报，但确实存在。Bou &amp; Satorra (2007) 的研究则表明利润持久性存在显著的行业差异。</p>\n<p><strong>折中观点</strong>认为，竞争优势的持续性取决于：(1) 隔离机制（Isolating Mechanisms）的强度，即模仿壁垒的高度；(2) 环境动态性的程度；(3) 企业自我更新的能力。在稳定环境中，RBV 的 VRIO 逻辑更适用；在高度动态环境中，动态能力和瞬时优势的思维更为恰当。</p>\n<h3 id=\"价值创造与价值捕获的分离\">价值创造与价值捕获的分离</h3><p>Brandenburger &amp; Stuart (1996) 提出的<strong>价值捕获模型</strong>是理解竞争优势的重要补充。企业创造的总附加价值等于消费者支付意愿（WTP）与供应商机会成本（OC）之差：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>附加价值</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>W</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{附加价值} = WTP - OC</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">附加价值</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>企业捕获的价值（利润）则取决于实际价格 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 与实际成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 之间的空间：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>利润</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{利润} = P - C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">利润</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>。竞争优势在于扩大 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">WTP - OC</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 并获得更大份额。差异化战略通过提高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">WTP</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 创造价值，成本领先通过降低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">OC</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 创造价值，但两者都需要议价能力来捕获这些价值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>选择一个你认为拥有持续竞争优势的企业（如茅台、苹果、台积电），分析其优势来源。分别用定位学派（活动系统）和资源基础观（VRIO）进行分析，两种视角提供了哪些互补的洞察？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>辩论题</strong>：D&#39;Aveni 认为持续竞争优势是&quot;幻觉&quot;，Barney 认为它是&quot;现实&quot;。你倾向于哪一方？请用具体企业案例支持你的论证。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>因果模糊性是模仿壁垒的重要来源，但它也带来一个悖论：如果管理者自己都不清楚优势的确切来源，他们如何有意识地培育和保护这种优势？请思考这个<strong>因果模糊性悖论（Causal Ambiguity Paradox）</strong>。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>用 Brandenburger &amp; Stuart 的价值捕获框架分析星巴克和瑞幸的竞争。两者的 WTP 和成本结构有何差异？各自捕获了多少创造出的价值？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>定量思考</strong>：一个行业的学习率为 85%，目前领先企业已累计生产了 100 万件产品，挑战者才开始第一件。假设初始单位成本相同，挑战者需要达到多少累计产量才能使其单位成本降到领先者当前水平？（提示：用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_n = C_1 \\cdot n^{-b}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 计算）</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>Barney, J.B. (1991) &quot;Firm Resources and Sustained Competitive Advantage&quot; — RBV 奠基论文，战略管理引用量最高的文章之一</li>\n<li>Porter, M.E. (1996) &quot;What Is Strategy?&quot; — HBR 经典，强调活动系统和战略契合</li>\n<li>Teece, D.J. (2007) &quot;Explicating Dynamic Capabilities&quot; — 动态能力的微观基础分析</li>\n<li>McGrath, R.G. (2013) <em>The End of Competitive Advantage</em> — 瞬时优势时代的战略逻辑</li>\n<li>Brandenburger, A.M. &amp; Stuart, H.W. (1996) &quot;Value-based Business Strategy&quot; — 价值创造与捕获的形式化模型</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>竞争优势研究的核心张力在于**结构（产业定位）vs. 资源（企业禀赋）<strong>和</strong>静态（持续优势）vs. 动态（暂时优势）**两对对立。成熟的战略思维需要整合多元视角：用定位学派理解&quot;在哪里竞争&quot;，用资源基础观理解&quot;用什么竞争&quot;，用动态能力理解&quot;如何在变化中持续竞争&quot;。接下来将探讨蓝海战略如何试图超越竞争本身，寻找无竞争的市场空间。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"研究生 战略管理 — 竞争优势的来源与持续性","id":"研究生-战略管理-竞争优势的来源与持续性"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"定位学派：从外部结构寻找优势","id":"定位学派-从外部结构寻找优势"},{"level":3,"text":"资源基础观：从内部禀赋寻找优势","id":"资源基础观-从内部禀赋寻找优势"},{"level":3,"text":"知识基础观与动态能力","id":"知识基础观与动态能力"},{"level":3,"text":"竞争优势的持续性","id":"竞争优势的持续性"},{"level":3,"text":"价值创造与价值捕获的分离","id":"价值创造与价值捕获的分离"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"研究生 战略管理 — 产业分析与竞争格局","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/management/strategic-management-grad/competitive/industry-analysis"},"next":{"title":"研究生 战略管理 — 蓝海战略与价值创新","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/management/strategic-management-grad/competitive/blue-ocean-strategy"}}